set groups apbr security advance-policy-based-routing from-zone IOT policy 02 match destination-address any
set groups apbr security advance-policy-based-routing from-zone IOT policy 02 match application any
set groups apbr security advance-policy-based-routing from-zone IOT policy 02 then application-services advance-policy-based-routing-profile IOT_001
set groups apbr security advance-policy-based-routing from-zone MGMT policy 01 match source-address 10-10-10-0_24
set groups apbr security advance-policy-based-routing from-zone MGMT policy 01 match destination-address any
set groups apbr security advance-policy-based-routing from-zone MGMT policy 01 match application any
