set groups apbr security advance-policy-based-routing from-zone GUEST policy 01 match destination-address any
set groups apbr security advance-policy-based-routing from-zone GUEST policy 01 match application any
set groups apbr security advance-policy-based-routing from-zone GUEST policy 01 then application-services advance-policy-based-routing-profile GUEST
set groups apbr security advance-policy-based-routing from-zone MEDIA policy 01 match source-address 10-10-40-0_24
set groups apbr security advance-policy-based-routing from-zone MEDIA policy 01 match destination-address any
